1
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:32,300
"My Rival and Me"

2
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,300
(Episode 7)

3
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:14,813
I've really done it now. Did I
magically turn a straight guy gay?

4
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:20,480
You just gave me a little kiss,

5
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:21,640
then fell straight asleep,

6
00:01:21,719 --> 00:01:23,599
leaving me here awake all night.

7
00:01:32,519 --> 00:01:36,239
I secretly shipped us so hard
that I turned myself gay,

8
00:01:36,319 --> 00:01:38,920
then basked in his kindness and affection

9
00:01:38,959 --> 00:01:41,959
and dragged him into this too.

10
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:54,885
Oh, Gu Yiliang.

11
00:01:54,910 --> 00:01:58,845
When you wake up,
how am I supposed to face you?

12
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,120
Get some rest.

13
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,400
You have a big scene tomorrow.

14
00:02:53,463 --> 00:02:55,630
[Good morning, do your best the whole day!]

15
00:03:07,303 --> 00:03:09,096
[Today's outfit was
hand-selected by Master Wei]

16
00:03:29,396 --> 00:03:31,129
[Today's breakfast was prepared
by Chef Wei, Bon Appetit]

17
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:41,280
Is he always this attentive
to his sugar daddies?

18
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:50,639
Look at that bird.

19
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:52,439
A real bird!
[It isn't]

20
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,120
And that fish.

21
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:57,439
A real fish!
[It's not]

22
00:03:57,719 --> 00:04:01,080
Niangzi is real! Niangzi is real!

23
00:04:01,159 --> 00:04:02,199
Niangzi!

24
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,520
And that bell.

25
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:05,919
A real bell!

26
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,400
Niangzi!

27
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:09,560
How long has your boss been like this?

28
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,840
Years.

29
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:12,599
Yanyan has a big scene today.

30
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:14,159
That means at least ten takes.

31
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:16,519
We'll all be here all night again.

32
00:04:16,879 --> 00:04:19,079
Better order coffee for the whole crew.

33
00:04:20,639 --> 00:04:21,279
To drink?

34
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,600
The usual.

35
00:04:22,839 --> 00:04:23,839
An Americano.

36
00:04:25,399 --> 00:04:26,839
Extra strong.

37
00:04:39,399 --> 00:04:41,759
Thank you for looking after me
all this time.

38
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:44,160
But time waits for no one.

39
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,000
Safe travels.

40
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,160
We met by chance,

41
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:51,519
without even knowing
each other's true names.

42
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:53,079
Yet our paths have crossed,

43
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,839
and I hope they will again.

44
00:05:04,319 --> 00:05:05,319
No need to see me out.

45
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,480
My carriage is just outside.

46
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,240
Farewell.

47
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:09,759
Wait.

48
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,199
There's something else I want to say.

49
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:27,240
May all your wishes come true,

50
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,800
May you live free of sorrow.

51
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,920
Cut!

52
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:46,319
That's a take!

53
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:48,120
One take!

54
00:05:48,639 --> 00:05:50,480
We won't be here all night!

55
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,360
Hey, hey.

56
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,879
Mr. Wei, wake up!

57
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,040
You did great.

58
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:03,560
We got it?

59
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,079
We did.

60
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:04,759
Really?

61
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:05,800
Yes.

62
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,439
Wei, you were really on form.

63
00:06:09,639 --> 00:06:11,040
I told you, you're a quick learner.

64
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:14,000
Such progress! Such emotion!
You outdid yourself.

65
00:06:18,399 --> 00:06:19,399
Director.

66
00:06:19,439 --> 00:06:21,920
Did Mr. Huang invest more money
in the show again?

67
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:23,519
Don't be ridiculous.

68
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,319
No. Well, not much.

69
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:25,879
What?

70
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,079
No, I mean...

71
00:06:27,199 --> 00:06:29,759
You put so much feeling into that.

72
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:32,680
Is there a girl you've fallen for?

73
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,720
No, Gu Yi...
[It sounds like "It wasn't intentional"]

74
00:06:35,936 --> 00:06:37,536
I never meant

75
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:40,800
to lose myself along the way.

76
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,639
For you,

77
00:06:42,879 --> 00:06:47,000
I try so hard to be perfect.

78
00:06:47,959 --> 00:06:48,959
You sing well too.

79
00:06:49,439 --> 00:06:50,839
Thank you, Director. Thank you.

80
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:55,720
Good thing I'm quick on my feet,

81
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,279
and musically gifted.

82
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,040
I heard you got it in one take.

83
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,480
You've really improved.

84
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,800
You're too kind.

85
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,399
I had a great teacher.

86
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:23,879
My phone.

87
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:25,360
Where's my phone?

88
00:07:25,839 --> 00:07:26,839
I'll find my phone.

89
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:27,920
I'll let you get on.

90
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,240
See you.

91
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:30,480
Chen!

92
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:32,040
Where has that little brat gone?

93
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,160
Chen!

94
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,839
Where's my phone?

95
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:47,519
Hello?

96
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,720
What?

97
00:07:49,399 --> 00:07:51,360
Oh, my dear Mr. Huang.

98
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:53,680
Stop secretly funding my production.

99
00:07:54,199 --> 00:07:55,240
Stop sending me money too.

100
00:07:57,839 --> 00:07:59,120
You just won't listen, will you?

101
00:08:04,199 --> 00:08:05,199
Mr. Gu.

102
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,560
Looking for our Yanyan?

103
00:08:09,879 --> 00:08:10,319
No.

104
00:08:10,879 --> 00:08:11,279
Passing.

105
00:08:11,319 --> 00:08:13,800
Stop, stop. Enough. Bye-bye.

106
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,679
Why is your face so red?

107
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,320
I...

108
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,480
Are you feeling unwell?

109
00:08:54,559 --> 00:08:55,360
No.

110
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:57,000
I'm hot. Just hot.

111
00:08:58,279 --> 00:09:00,200
Director Lu wants a crew dinner tonight.

112
00:09:00,279 --> 00:09:01,279
Oh, okay.

113
00:09:01,519 --> 00:09:03,840
Okay, I admit it. I'm done for.

114
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:06,480
Looks like I've really fallen for someone.

115
00:09:06,559 --> 00:09:09,200
Gu Yiliang.

116
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:12,200
Here's to a smooth shoot for Lan Jue!

117
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,840
Cheers!

118
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,919
Cheers!

119
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:20,440
Sit down, everyone. Eat while it's hot.

120
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:23,679
Help yourselves.

121
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,960
Director Lu's treat?

122
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,399
At a place like this?

123
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,440
How generous.

124
00:09:29,879 --> 00:09:31,759
Director Lu said you're treating us.

125
00:09:32,159 --> 00:09:33,159
I am?

126
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:38,240
Oh, right. It's on me.

127
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:40,720
What a lavish feast.

128
00:09:40,799 --> 00:09:42,159
How much did Huang spend on this?

129
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,280
I'll eat my money's worth.

130
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,960
Why aren't you eating?

131
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,120
What's wrong?

132
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,039
Nothing.

133
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:04,240
Go ahead.

134
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:28,840
Yanzi.

135
00:10:29,919 --> 00:10:32,080
Got any leads on our next show?

136
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,960
Not at the moment.

137
00:10:34,519 --> 00:10:35,200
Why?

138
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:37,320
Nothing. I was just thinking.

139
00:10:37,399 --> 00:10:39,840
Everything's gone so smoothly for you.

140
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,240
We're not so lucky.

141
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:43,360
We have no connections,

142
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:46,039
so we have to work our way up ourselves.

143
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:47,679
So,

144
00:10:47,759 --> 00:10:49,440
I wanted to ask your advice.

145
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:52,279
How did you learn to work such miracles?

146
00:10:53,519 --> 00:10:55,600
It's all down to fate.

147
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:58,000
I suggest a visit to Nanpu Temple.

148
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,480
Praying there really works.

149
00:11:00,519 --> 00:11:01,519
Yanzi, wait!

150
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,159
I'll be sure to go.

151
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:05,039
But first, let me toast you again.

152
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,639
May your good luck

153
00:11:06,759 --> 00:11:08,480
last forever.

154
00:11:11,519 --> 00:11:12,519
You don't have to drink.

155
00:11:13,799 --> 00:11:14,799
I'll drink with you.

156
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,840
Thank you, sir.

157
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,720
Why are you drinking?

158
00:11:19,799 --> 00:11:22,080
You drink worse than I act.

159
00:11:22,159 --> 00:11:22,799
Sir.

160
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:25,200
I really admire true talent like yours.

161
00:11:25,679 --> 00:11:26,360
Some people

162
00:11:26,399 --> 00:11:27,440
may climb high,

163
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,440
but whether it's luck behind them

164
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,679
or something else...

165
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,320
Who can say?

166
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,720
Enough of the chatter.

167
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,360
If you admire me, drink up.

168
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:37,720
Drink.

169
00:11:37,759 --> 00:11:38,759
Come on.

170
00:11:41,639 --> 00:11:42,039
Sir.

171
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:42,600
I'll go.

172
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:43,720
Come back.

173
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,279
Has no one taught you

174
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:47,679
how to clink glasses with your seniors?

175
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:50,960
Sorry. I'm sorry.

176
00:11:51,399 --> 00:11:52,399
An apology drink.

177
00:11:52,639 --> 00:11:53,840
Finish that one first.

178
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,840
Yes. Bottoms up.

179
00:12:00,159 --> 00:12:01,639
Finished. Now another.

180
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,200
Go easy.

181
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:09,320
Sir, it was my fault.

182
00:12:16,759 --> 00:12:17,480
Bottoms up!

183
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,600
But, sir...

184
00:12:18,799 --> 00:12:19,799
Keep going.

185
00:12:20,039 --> 00:12:21,039
Drink, drink, drink.

186
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:31,480
Come on.

187
00:12:31,759 --> 00:12:32,759
Drink.

188
00:12:33,039 --> 00:12:34,039
That's enough.

189
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,080
We're all getting drunk!

190
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:37,120
Come on.

191
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:44,000
You can really hold your liquor.

192
00:12:47,679 --> 00:12:48,399
Keep drinking.

193
00:12:48,519 --> 00:12:49,559
Drink.

194
00:12:50,759 --> 00:12:51,720
Why drink so much?

195
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:52,840
What are you on about?

196
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,879
I'm going to the restroom.

197
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,039
Don't go, sir.

198
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,320
Let's keep going!

199
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:13,080
Go check on him.

200
00:13:29,399 --> 00:13:30,399
Yanyan.

201
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,159
Sorry. I'm sorry.

202
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,120
It's okay.

203
00:13:37,186 --> 00:13:38,186
Yanyan?

204
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,200
Don't you remember me?

205
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,879
Oh, Uncle Qi, right?

206
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:43,440
Sorry. I didn't recognize you.

207
00:13:43,519 --> 00:13:45,679
Why didn't you say you were filming here?

208
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:47,200
I could look after you for Huang.

209
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,440
Uncle Qi, this is my friend.

210
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:57,159
Our crew's having dinner here together.

211
00:13:58,559 --> 00:13:59,559
Friend?

212
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,320
What's with this veteran actor?

213
00:14:02,399 --> 00:14:03,919
He's been spoiling for a fight.

214
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,039
Yanyan.

215
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:05,720
Yes?

216
00:14:05,919 --> 00:14:06,919
I don't feel well.

217
00:14:07,919 --> 00:14:08,919
Take me back.

218
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,440
Uncle Qi,

219
00:14:12,519 --> 00:14:13,519
I'm sorry,

220
00:14:13,559 --> 00:14:15,080
but I have to go.

221
00:14:15,279 --> 00:14:16,320
I'll visit another time.

222
00:14:16,879 --> 00:14:17,960
Come on. Let's go.

223
00:14:18,279 --> 00:14:20,120
How much did you drink?

224
00:14:25,759 --> 00:14:27,000
Lucas.

225
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:30,039
Have you seen our big guy, Gu?

226
00:14:30,159 --> 00:14:30,879
No.

227
00:14:30,919 --> 00:14:32,360
Where's our Yanyan?

228
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,840
Yanyan!

229
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,159
Where did you go?

230
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:43,799
I was so worried about you.

231
00:14:45,039 --> 00:14:46,519
You're such a phony.

232
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:48,600
Gu!

233
00:14:48,639 --> 00:14:50,919
I'm the one who's worried about you!

234
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:52,360
I...

235
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:57,360
How will everyone get home in this state?

236
00:14:57,759 --> 00:14:58,960
Go with him.

237
00:14:59,679 --> 00:15:00,679
Chen Youyuan!

238
00:15:00,919 --> 00:15:02,039
Chen Youyuan, get up!

239
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:03,240
Chen Youyuan!

240
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,360
Love is a cup of wine.

241
00:15:07,399 --> 00:15:08,960
It gets everyone drunk.

242
00:15:11,879 --> 00:15:13,360
Mingming, could you call me

243
00:15:13,799 --> 00:15:14,799
a cab?

244
00:15:16,799 --> 00:15:18,120
Never mind. I'll call one myself.

245
00:15:32,799 --> 00:15:34,639
The buses must have stopped by now.

246
00:15:35,639 --> 00:15:36,759
I'll splurge tonight.

247
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,000
I'll get a cab.

248
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,600
Cancel it. Cancel!

249
00:15:42,679 --> 00:15:43,559
Too expensive.

250
00:15:43,639 --> 00:15:44,639
Forget it.

251
00:15:45,639 --> 00:15:46,639
Mingming.

252
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:49,960
Why are you here?

253
00:15:50,279 --> 00:15:51,279
Picking you up.

254
00:15:52,399 --> 00:15:54,639
Haven't you been really busy lately?

255
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:56,720
I have time to pick you up.

256
00:16:02,159 --> 00:16:03,159
Here.

257
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:06,120
What's this?

258
00:16:06,159 --> 00:16:07,159
Soup to sober you up.

259
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:11,279
Soup to sober me up?

260
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,559
How can you be so clumsy?

261
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:25,879
Thank goodness.

262
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:27,159
You're okay.

263
00:16:46,919 --> 00:16:47,919
It stopped hurting.

264
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,440
Let's go home.

265
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:49,119
What are you doing?

266
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,279
Taking my clothes off.

267
00:17:52,759 --> 00:17:54,599
Want to make the news? Behave yourself!

268
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:56,920
We're home. Shouldn't I get undressed?

269
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:59,599
No! What are you doing?

270
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:01,279
Are we going or not?

271
00:18:01,319 --> 00:18:02,400
Yes, please, let's go.

272
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:04,920
I can't hold him back much longer.

273
00:18:06,079 --> 00:18:07,079
Keep them on!

274
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:11,000
Why aren't we moving?

275
00:18:11,119 --> 00:18:12,519
Last four digits of your number?

276
00:18:12,839 --> 00:18:14,039
8602.

277
00:18:28,319 --> 00:18:30,680
Stop rubbing against me!

278
00:18:30,759 --> 00:18:32,920
Please behave.

279
00:18:33,079 --> 00:18:34,799
We're almost home. Be good.

280
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:36,880
Okay.

281
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:38,240
Whatever you say.

282
00:18:40,039 --> 00:18:43,240
But I'm not the only one in your heart.

283
00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:59,559
Don't throw up! Not in his car!

284
00:18:59,559 --> 00:19:00,640
Don't throw up. Hold it in.

285
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:01,640
Hold it in.

286
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:33,240
Why is that dog Cheng so good tonight?

287
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:43,640
Go to sleep. Good night.

288
00:19:50,279 --> 00:19:52,119
Does Cheng Yan have a split personality?

289
00:19:52,200 --> 00:19:55,279
Or have I lost my appeal?

290
00:20:09,759 --> 00:20:12,480
