342
00:24:11,839 --> 00:24:12,839
Fanfics.

343
00:24:13,440 --> 00:24:14,440
The fanfics!

344
00:24:28,440 --> 00:24:29,680
Why is it that in every fanfic,

345
00:24:30,039 --> 00:24:32,200
